### 1.1. Create a new Post (201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Architektury Usług Internetowych - Lab 3",
  "content": "Testowanie kontrolerów REST za pomocą pliku request.http."
}

> {%
    client.global.set("postId", response.body.postId);
%}

### 1.2. Get the created Post by ID (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts/{{postId}}
Accept: application/json

### 1.3. Get a non-existent Post by ID (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### 1.4. Update the existing Post (200 OK)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/posts/{{postId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "title": "Architektury Usług Internetowych - Lab 3 (Zaktualizowany)",
  "content": "Zaktualizowana treść posta po wywołaniu metody PUT."
}

### 1.5. Verify the updated Post (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts/{{postId}}
Accept: application/json

### 2.1. Create a new Comment under the Post (201 Created)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts/{{postId}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "authorName": "Jan Kowalski",
  "content": "Pierwszy komentarz testowy dodany przez REST API."
}

> {%
    client.global.set("commentId", response.body.commentId);
%}

### 2.2. Create a Comment under a non-existent Post (404 Not Found)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/posts/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/comments
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "authorName": "Jan Kowalski",
  "content": "Ten komentarz nie powinien zostać utworzony."
}

### 2.3. Get the created Comment by ID (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts/{{postId}}/comments/{{commentId}}
Accept: application/json

### 2.4. Update the existing Comment (200 OK)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/posts/{{postId}}/comments/{{commentId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "authorName": "Jan Kowalski (Edytowany)",
  "content": "Zaktualizowana treść komentarza po wywołaniu metody PUT."
}

### 2.5. Verify the updated Comment (200 OK)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts/{{postId}}/comments/{{commentId}}
Accept: application/json

### 2.6. Delete the Comment (204 No Content)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/posts/{{postId}}/comments/{{commentId}}

### 2.7. Verify the Comment was deleted (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts/{{postId}}/comments/{{commentId}}
Accept: application/json

### 3.1. Delete the Post (204 No Content)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/posts/{{postId}}

### 3.2. Verify the Post was deleted (404 Not Found)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/posts/{{postId}}
Accept: application/json
